# Product

LetsUpgrade: free certs for Indian students. Loop: learn → project → internships/jobs.

Full map: [CONTEXT.md](CONTEXT.md). Visual source (copy/layout only, no CSS classes): `/Users/akashlakade/Downloads/LU IDea`.

# Built now

- `/` home, `/programs` catalogue
- `/program/[id]` live track landing, `/bootcamp/[id]` recorded bootcamp landing
- `/auth` dummy login only (mobile + OTP `123456` → always Riya Sharma). No profile/signup.
- `/learn` Learning Centre — auth-gated. Tabs: Home, Learn, Opportunities, Career, Profile. Module player (6 stages), AI tutor drawer, course entry, enroll via `?course=`
- `/internships` internship board, `/jobs` fresher jobs board
- `/colleges` campus partnerships plus upskilling, certifications, placement, hire-ready, and contact pages
- `/resources` career guides, skill-fit check, events, community, help center
- `/blog` career guides plus four long-form articles
- `/refer` share link, WhatsApp, invite count after a classmate logs in

